{"id":"GHSA-cpgf-5mjf-73p7","axis":"advisories","repo":"rails/rails-html-sanitizer","sha":"f776f963b9d9346271aade9cb903e793fd38e865","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"CHANGELOG.md","lines":["@@ -1,3 +1,20 @@","+## next / unreleased","+","+* Deciding whether an SVG `href` or `xlink:href` is a local reference no longer takes quadratic time.","+","+  `PermitScrubber` matched the attribute value against a pattern that rescanned the value's","+  whitespace run from every line start, so an all-whitespace value took seconds to scrub. Only","+  Ruby 3.1 and earlier are affected, because Ruby 3.2 introduced linear-time regexp matching.","+  Through `PermitScrubber`, applications are only affected if the allowed tags are overridden to","+  include an SVG reference element such as `use`; the default configuration is not affected.","+","+  This change addresses GHSA-cpgf-5mjf-73p7. `PermitScrubber` now applies the html5lib attribute","+  value rules by calling `Loofah::HTML5::Scrub.scrub_attribute_value` rather than carrying its own","+  copy. The minimum Loofah dependency is now `~> 2.25, >= 2.25.3`.","+","+  *Mike Dalessio*","+","+"," ## v1.7.1 / 2026-07-15"," "," * SVG reference elements now restrict both `href` and `xlink:href` to local references."],"additions":17,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"Gemfile.lock","lines":["@@ -2,7 +2,7 @@ PATH","   remote: .","   specs:","     rails-html-sanitizer (1.7.1)","-      loofah (~> 2.25, >= 2.25.2)","+      loofah (~> 2.25, >= 2.25.3)","       nokogiri (>= 1.15.7, != 1.16.7, != 1.16.6, != 1.16.5, != 1.16.4, != 1.16.3, != 1.16.2, != 1.16.1, != 1.16.0.rc1, != 1.16.0)"," "," GEM","@@ -34,25 +34,25 @@ GEM","     language_server-protocol (3.17.0.5)","     lint_roller (1.1.0)","     logger (1.7.0)","-    loofah (2.25.2)","+    loofah (2.25.3)","       crass (~> 1.0.2)","-      nokogiri (>= 1.12.0)","+      nokogiri (>= 1.19.5)","     minitest (5.27.0)","-    nokogiri (1.19.4-aarch64-linux-gnu)","+    nokogiri (1.19.5-aarch64-linux-gnu)